 7. 👎 Youth poll: Thumbs down on everything 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Generation Lab. Chart: Danielle Alberti/Axios Asked which political party they trust more to bring down the cost of living, young Americans' top choice was neither (36%) — over Democrats (26%) or Republicans (22%) , Axios' Margaret Talev writes from a new Axios-Generation Lab poll of 18- to 34-year-olds. 

 "They're kind of thumbs-down on everything — how the president's doing, how the economy's doing, both political parties," said Generation Lab CEO Cyrus Beschloss. "AI is a pretty big disruptor. It's easy to point to one faceless thing as the cause." More data from the poll on AI, 2028 contenders and socialism. 

 
 
